## 9. Genie Agent

A Genie Agent was configured over approved Gold tables to support natural-language business analysis.

Three questions were validated against SQL:

1. Total net sales by category.
2. Top five stores by net sales.
3. Monthly net sales trend.

All three numerical comparisons matched the corresponding SQL results.

## 10. MLflow – Daily Demand Forecasting Baseline

A small daily sales forecasting baseline was developed using Gold sales features.

Implementation:
- Linear Regression model.
- Historical sales and calendar features.
- Chronological train/test split.
- MLflow experiment tracking.
- Model logging and reloading.
- Prediction generation.
- Evaluation using MAE, RMSE and R².

The model was successfully logged and loaded, and predictions were generated for 2,746 test records.

The experiment demonstrated limited predictive accuracy and is intended as a baseline extension rather than a production forecasting solution.

