## 12. Known Issues and Limitations

### Financial reconciliation
A ₹3.13 difference was observed between Silver-derived and Gold net-sales totals. Gross sales and discounts matched exactly.

### Genie citation quality
One Genie response returned an unrelated query citation, although the numerical answer matched SQL.

### Forecasting performance
The Linear Regression baseline produced:
- MAE: approximately 32,725.
- RMSE: approximately 41,764.
- R²: approximately -0.004.

Further feature engineering and alternative forecasting approaches may be considered in future releases.

### Data coverage
The available sales data covers July 1 to August 25, 2026. August represents a partial reporting month.

